flowchart LR
  INPUT[USB camera or local replay] --> FRAME[Frame identity and source time]
  FRAME --> MODEL[Preprocessing and Diego model adapter]
  MODEL --> EVENT[Detection metadata plus representative image]
  EVENT --> BUFFER[Persistent bounded outbox]
  TEL[Telemetry and health] --> BUFFER
  AGENT[Edge agent and valid controller commands] --> SYNC[Retry and synchronization client]
  BUFFER --> SYNC
  SYNC --> INGEST[James central ingestion]
  INGEST --> STORE[Ethan durable metadata and image storage]
  STORE --> REVIEW[Complete event available for human review]
  STORE --> ACK[Durable completion receipt]
  ACK --> SYNC
  SYNC --> CLEAN[Local cleanup under retention policy]
